fn group n ulong to void
fixture
put pconfig 0 1024
put pconfig 1 0
put pconfig 2 1
put pconfig 3 32
put pconfig 4 0
for i ulong 128
put parmids i get sid rem i 32
end
check eq pstart n 0
end
fn trial ord ulong to void
for i ulong 56
put pobs i 0
end
put pobs 0 div ord 4
arm = rem add ord div ord 4 4
put pobs 1 arm
for i ulong 32
put pobs add i 24 get parmids add mul arm 32 i
end
put pobs 2 1
for i ulong 8
put pobs add i 3 add i 1
end
put pobs 11 64
put pobs 12 1000
put pobs 13 1010
put pobs 14 1200
if eq arm 3
put pobs 14 1100
end
put pobs 15 1000
put pobs 16 1
put pobs 17 1
put pobs 18 1
put pobs 20 7
put pobs 22 ord
put pobs 23 1024
end
fn green to void
group 8
check eq pfinish 75
for i ulong 32
trial i
check eq padd 0
end
check eq pfinish 0
for a ulong 3
check eq preport a 0
check eq get summary 0 8
check eq get summary 1 a
check eq get summary 2 2000000
check eq get summary 3 2000000
check eq get summary 4 2000000
check eq get summary 5 100
check eq get summary 6 100
check eq get summary 7 10
check eq get summary 8 10
check eq get summary 9 1000
check eq get summary 10 1
check eq get summary 11 1
end
check eq preport 3 65
note Correctness mismatch poisons comparisons, even with explicit success flags.
put praw add prow 0 3 7 999
check eq pfinish 69
check eq preport 0 69
end
fn small to void
group 5
for i ulong 20
trial i
check eq padd 0
end
check eq preport 2 0
check eq get summary 10 0
check eq get summary 3 0
check eq get summary 4 18446744073709551615
check eq prank 5 0
check eq prank 6 1
check eq prank 8 1
check eq prank 10 2
end
fn outcomes to void
group 6
for i ulong 24
trial i
put pobs 14 1200
check eq padd 0
end
check eq preport 1 0
check eq get summary 10 2
group 6
for i ulong 24
trial i
if eq get pobs 1 3
put pobs 14 1400
end
check eq padd 0
end
check eq preport 1 0
check eq get summary 2 500000
check eq get summary 10 3
group 6
for i ulong 24
trial i
put pobs 11 1
check eq padd 0
end
check eq preport 1 0
check eq get summary 10 0
end
