fn main to int
green
small
outcomes
invalid
note Missing baseline identities must not make an unqualified base look comparable.
for a ulong 2
for d ulong 8
group 6
for j ulong 4
put parmids add add mul a 32 mul d 4 j 0
end
check eq pstart 6 69
end
end
ret finish
end
